.TH RETA\-PROMPT\-COMPLETE 1 "July 2026" "reta_arch_mojo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
reta\-prompt\-complete \- native prompt completion helper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B reta\-prompt\-complete
.RI [ ARGUMENT ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B reta\-prompt\-complete
is the compiled completion helper for prompt frontends.

.SH NOTES
This command is installed because it is a build or diagnostic target of the native Mojo port. Normal users usually start with .BR reta (1), .BR rp (1), .BR rpl (1), .BR rpe (1), or .BR rpb (1).
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success and non-zero on errors, failed checks, missing build targets, or invalid arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR reta(1), rp(1), rpl(1), rpe(1), rpb(1)
